   "xml_name": "PS2_014_Function Quotient And Remainder",
   "display_name": "Quotient And Remainder",
   "questiontext_html": "<p>Write a function named <code>divide</code> that takes two whole numbers <code>a</code> and <code>b</code> and <b>returns two values</b>: the quotient (<code>a // b</code>) and the remainder (<code>a % b</code>), in that order.</p>\n<p>You may assume <code>b</code> is always greater than 0.</p>\n<p><b>Example:</b> <code>divide(17, 5)</code> should return <code>3</code> and <code>2</code>.</p>",
