   "display_name": "Age Category",
   "questiontext_html": "<p>Write a function named <code>category</code> that takes a person's age (a whole number) and <b>returns</b> their age group: <code>\"Child\"</code> for age below 13, <code>\"Teen\"</code> for age 13 to 19 (inclusive), <code>\"Adult\"</code> for age 20 to 59 (inclusive), and <code>\"Senior\"</code> for age 60 or above.</p>\n<p>You may assume age is always 0 or above.</p>\n<p><b>Example:</b> <code>category(15)</code> should return <code>\"Teen\"</code>.</p>",
