   "xml_index": 17,
   "xml_name": "PS2_017_Function Leap Year",
   "display_name": "Leap Year",
   "questiontext_html": "<p>A <b>leap year</b> is one with an extra day (29th February). The exact rule: a year is a leap year if it is divisible by 4, AND if it is also divisible by 100 then it must also be divisible by 400. So 2024 is a leap year, 1900 is not (divisible by 100 but not 400), and 2000 is (divisible by 400).</p>\n<p>Write a function named <code>is_leap</code> that takes a whole number year and <b>returns</b> <code>True</code> if it is a leap year, or <code>False</code> otherwise.</p>\n<p>You may assume the year is always a positive whole number.</p>\n<p><b>Example:</b> <code>is_leap(2024)</code> should return <code>True</code>. <code>is_leap(1900)</code> should return <code>False</code>.</p>",
   "answerpreload": "",
   "mark": 1.0,
   "tests": [
    {
     "testcode": "print(is_leap(2024))",
     "stdin": "",
     "expected": "True",
     "extra": "",
     "show": true,
     "example": true,
     "in_precheck": true,
     "in_check": true
    },
